  "prefLabel": "Saf-Mec 307.02 Effect of Signature on Application for License as a Mechanical Business",
  "priorExpiration": "2015-07-20",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-Mec 307.02 Effect of Signature on Application for License as a Mechanical Business. Each applicant shall sign the application which acknowledges the statement below:\n\n\"I acknowledge that, under RSA 641:3, I, knowingly making a false statement on this application form is a misdemeanor. I certify that the information I have provided on all parts of the application form and in the documents that I have personally submitted to support my\n\napplication is complete and accurate to the best of my knowledge and belief. I also certify that I have read RSA 153:27 through RSA 153:38 and the rules of the board and will abide by them.\"\n\nSource. #10648, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 7-25-14, EXPIRES: 1-21-15; ss by #10761, INTERIM, eff 1-21-15, EXPIRES: 7-20-15; ss by #10847, eff 7-1-15",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-mec300.html"
}
